  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u763cc7a2\" id=\"u763cc7a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78d6df33\" id=\"u78d6df33\">不同的版本各有优缺点，都会出现在未来的工作项目里，我们这里根据复杂程度和封装程度，进行逐步的版本演进，在不同芯片平台，都是通用的。仅仅要求用到一个定时器，通过中断更新一个计数值，就可以将该框架运行起来。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"quklG\" id=\"quklG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a30c47f\" id=\"u7a30c47f\">裸机多任务V1.0版</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u24488a9a\" id=\"u24488a9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60a3da2e\" id=\"u60a3da2e\">参考示例：</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2F7z%2F27903758%2F1751291835035-68c75a47-5597-42a2-b3bc-63b9cef38734.7z%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2204_GD32_tasks_v1.0.7z%22%2C%22size%22%3A65265%2C%22ext%22%3A%227z%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8563ea2d-7e17-4bff-be6f-a3ad89bb3ca%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf7196b54%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc98cd74a\" id=\"uc98cd74a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1934f745\" id=\"u1934f745\">实现步骤：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8562fdce\" id=\"u8562fdce\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1d7fab0\" id=\"ud1d7fab0\">定时器更新计数值num，当计数值num到目标值，重置num数值，并将flag设置为1</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22tasks_timer.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20...%5Cnvolatile%20uint64_t%20tasks_tick%3B%5Cn%5Cnvolatile%20uint8_t%20task1_flag%20%3D%200%3B%5Cnvolatile%20uint8_t%20task2_flag%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%5Cnvolatile%20uint64_t%20task1_num%20%3D%200%3B%5Cnvolatile%20uint64_t%20task2_num%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20TIMER6_IRQHandler()%7B%5Cn%5Ctif(SET%20%3D%3D%20timer_interrupt_flag_get(TIMER_PER